      "abstract": "Bioinformatics teams face an unsustainable cycle: scientists depend on them for every analysis while infrastructure demands outpace capacity. We explore how AI automation empowers scientists to work independently, shifts teams from firefighting to strategic work, and integrates with existing infrastructureâ€”bringing these capabilities together through Seqera, the intelligent engine for the life sciences.",
