      "format": "",
      "authors": "Zhongwu Lai, Ziv-Bar Joseph, Lihua Yu",
      "abstract": "This industry workshop features three expert panels on how AI/ML is reshaping biopharma drug discovery, genomic medicine, and life sciences investment. Leaders from top pharma, biotech, and VC firms will share candid perspectives on real-world AI applications, what they look for when hiring, and how early- career scientists can position themselves for impact in industry. Each 30-minute panel opens with brief panelist introductions, followed by interactive discussion. Ideal for graduate students, postdocs, and early- career researchers in computational biology, bioinformatics, or data science who are curious about industry careers or entrepreneurship.",
