      "searchText": "2026-07-14 15:20:00 15:50:00 9-10 combo industry workshop venture partner kristina e. kitko, anthony philippakis, john keilty this industry workshop features three expert panels on how ai/ml is reshaping biopharma drug discovery, genomic medicine, and life sciences investment. leaders from top pharma, biotech, and vc firms will share candid perspectives on real-world ai applications, what they look for when hiring, and how early- career scientists can position themselves for impact in industry. each 30-minute panel opens with brief panelist introductions, followed by interactive discussion. ideal for graduate students, postdocs, and early- career researchers in computational biology, bioinformatics, or data science who are curious about industry careers or entrepreneurship."
