      "title": "NIGMS Funding Opportunities",
      "presenter": "Guoqin Yu",
      "format": "In person",
      "authors": "Guoqin Yu",
      "abstract": "The National Institute of General Medical Sciences (NIGMS) at the National Institutes of Health (NIH) supports basic research that increases our understanding of biological processes and lays the foundation for advances in disease diagnosis, treatment, and prevention. NIGMS accomplishes this mission through: (1) funding research projects and career development; (2) funding Resources and Centers that provide the biomedical community access to research technologies, expertise and training in technology use. This presentation will provide an overview of funding opportunities for research and career development, and biology and funding opportunities for early-career scientists.",
